":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" doesn’t reach, such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a UI framework’s button actions: hand the part of the app a screen owns a tracker enriched"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with that screen."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let checkout = tracker.enriched(by: Enricher { $0[ScreenKey.self] = \"Checkout\" })","checkout.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))  \/\/ its record's context[ScreenKey.self] is \"Checkout\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker runs "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enricher"},{"type":"text","text":", never the tracking caller, on the context "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"took and before the enrichers the tracker was built with, which see what it set. Enriching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a copy again runs the new enricher after the copy’s, so the newest sets a key last. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" tracker’s copy drops every event too."}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV8enriched2byAC6Events8EnricherV_tF","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/S